00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:11.500
The agents acted on real websites or systems, sometimes bypassing restrictions, andthropic

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:15.140
agents submitted 20 incomplete visa applications through a public state

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:19.860
department form. None of the applications were processed. A study found that AI

00:02:19.860 --> 00:02:23.560
agents placed an isolation formed polarized groups without external

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:27.800
prompting. A report states that nearly half of enterprises bypassed their

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:32.400
